 "lyrics": [
  {
   "start": 18.6,
   "end": 20.3,
   "text": "Lay awake at night"
  },
  {
   "start": 20.8,
   "end": 22.5,
   "text": "Wondering how could I"
  },
  {
   "start": 22.9,
   "end": 24.5,
   "text": "Let it get this way"
  },
  {
   "start": 27.5,
   "end": 29.0,
   "text": "Through all the pain"
  },
  {
   "start": 29.5,
   "end": 31.2,
   "text": "I took all the blame"
  },
  {
   "start": 31.9,
   "end": 33.5,
   "text": "While you cursed my last name"
  },
  {
   "start": 36.2,
   "end": 38.0,
   "text": "I thought we could get better"
  },
  {
   "start": 38.5,
   "end": 40.2,
   "text": "Stay committed like a soldier"
  },
  {
   "start": 40.9,
   "end": 42.5,
   "text": "Believed we're okay"
  },
  {
   "start": 44.4,
   "end": 49.5,
   "text": "Now I know that you don't care at all"
  },
  {
   "start": 53.5,
   "end": 55.0,
   "text": "Time wasted"
  },
  {
   "start": 55.2,
   "end": 57.9,
   "text": "Gave all of my soul and my heart"
  },
  {
   "start": 58.0,
   "end": 62.2,
   "text": "To someone that would never give me the same"
  },
  {
   "start": 62.4,
   "end": 66.1,
   "text": "I was a fool to believe that you"
  },
  {
   "start": 66.3,
   "end": 71.1,
   "text": "Would finally be the one to give me the same"
  },
  {
   "start": 71.3,
   "end": 75.0,
   "text": "Heart broken now"
  },
  {
   "start": 75.7,
   "end": 79.2,
   "text": "How you let me down"
  },
  {
   "start": 79.8,
   "end": 88.0,
   "text": "But somehow deep down I still do love you"
  },
  {
   "start": 91.9,
   "end": 93.5,
   "text": "Now you're up all night"
  },
  {
   "start": 94.4,
   "end": 95.5,
   "text": "Telling your lies"
  },
  {
   "start": 96.3,
   "end": 98.0,
   "text": "About the way I hurt you"
  },
  {
   "start": 98.4,
   "end": 100.0,
   "text": "They couldn't see the way"
  },
  {
   "start": 100.6,
   "end": 102.2,
   "text": "You made me feel ashamed"
  },
  {
   "start": 103.0,
   "end": 105.2,
   "text": "For choosing to love you"
  },
  {
   "start": 107.4,
   "end": 109.2,
   "text": "I began to see clearer"
  },
  {
   "start": 109.8,
   "end": 111.5,
   "text": "That you were just a liar"
  },
  {
   "start": 112.0,
   "end": 113.5,
   "text": "Stuck in your ways"
  },
  {
   "start": 115.3,
   "end": 123.5,
   "text": "So now I choose to walk away forever"
  },
  {
   "start": 124.6,
   "end": 126.2,
   "text": "Time wasted"
  },
  {
   "start": 126.3,
