  },
  {
   "start": 150.8,
   "end": 159.0,
   "text": "But somehow deep down I still do love you"
  },
  {
   "start": 160.6,
   "end": 164.5,
   "text": "How could you just throw it all away"
  },
  {
   "start": 169.1,
